  "_meta": {
    "field": "parrying_version",
    "note": "Wiki-harvested seed shard. Values are verbatim from the DDO wiki; `provenance` records whether the wiki stated the value, fell back to a template default, or is silent. Only `stated` is solver-eligible.",
    "snapshots_note": "Rendered-tooltip snapshots keyed by case-normalized template invocation. The tooltip is a pure function of the invocation, so this is keyed per invocation, not per item. Exclude-until-verified: ships empty and fills as invocations are rendered; audit_snapshots() reports the shortfall so an empty store cannot read as coverage.",
    "stacking_note": "Wiki-stated interaction (Heightened Awareness page, Notes): \"Does not stack with the insight bonus to AC provided by the parrying suffix.\" Both affixes emit Armor Class as an Insight bonus, so the solver's bucket-max core (sum(z) <= 1 per (stat, bonus_type) bucket) enforces this without a special case -- provided both keep emitting the SAME stat name and the SAME bonus type. Retyping either one silently restores double-counting."
  },
